Whitney Hodges: Like what played into their decision. Because when we know that information, that can then be like layered back into your ad strategy or your marketing strategy as a whole. And so if you guys are interested and if you are open to it, we can actually create a market research survey for you in Leadlock for both Functastic and DJ Hybrid. It would just really kind of be up to you guys, right?

